  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GapMinder II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC is considering an equity investment of up to EUR10 million in GapMinder Fund II Co&#xf6;peratief U.A. (the Fund) an early-stage venture capital fund that will invest in pre-seed and seed stage technology companies in Romania and Central-Eastern European Regions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund is expected to increase access to early-stage venture capital financing and value creation services for technology startups that are mainly active in Romania and Central and Eastern Europe, resulting in business growth. Additionally, the Fund is expected to invest in at least 25 percent in startups co-founded by women, helping to address gender disparities in access to venture capital financing in the region. Beyond the project IFC investment is expected to strengthen the competitiveness of the traditional real, digital, and financial sectors in Romania and Central and Eastern Europe, through the expansion of investees with disruptive business models, via demonstration and replication and/or competition and innovation channels.</narrative>
  </description>
